{"labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn9le11ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think I'm having a financial crisis!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: If you hadn't won a million dollars I would have taken you seriously the last time you made the same announcement! I wish you wouldn't make a mountain out of a molehill.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Take a look at this Peter.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Is that your Visa bill? Holy cow!\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah, but I never made those purchases.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Someone must have used your credit card number or you are the victim of fraud. Can you remember where you shopped last?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn9le11ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If someone had taken my credit card, don't you think I would have noticed?</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter: </span>Not necessarily. All they need to do is swipe your card twice with a special device and they can steal your entire identity. It takes two seconds.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Do you think that  is what happened? Identity theft?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Maybe. Or it could've happened online.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I shouldn't have done all that online shopping. This would never have happened. I wish I could ignore this.", "id": 2, "time": "23000", "image": "engenn9le11ob05re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: If you hadn't told so many people that you won the lottery, maybe this would not have happened. Can you remember who you told?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I hardly told anyone! ... Anyway, do you know what I should do now?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I wish I knew. Besides reporting it to the credit card company and the police, there isn't much else you can do.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I wish this weren't happening! I think I'll report it now. Want to come to the police station with me for moral support?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Sure, Sal!", "id": 3, "time": "50000", "image": "engenn9le11ob05re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le11ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le11ob05re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about emotions, opinions, money and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about hypothetical situations in the past. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for clarification and information.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What is one of your most cherished possessions?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How would you have reacted if someone had tried to steal it in the past?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "What if you had lost something?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_id